<font size=2>[90]</font> <font size=4 color=#40c0c0> 追記</font>
</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2006/07/17 (月) 00:42:22 <strong>▽</strong> Ｋ．伊藤 </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs.cgi?res=200607171004222&log=k_ito">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200607171004222"></font>
